==Finnish==

===Suffix===
'''-ton'''/'''-tön'''

# (''denominal'') Indicates lack of something (similar to [[-less]]) or [[in-]], [[im-]],[[il-]] and [[ir-]]

====Antonyms====
*[[-llinen]]

====Declension====
See [[Wiktionary:Finnish inflection types/nouns/57|declension type 57]].

====Examples====
{{rfc-header|Examples}}
*[[ajaton]] = timeless
*[[järjetön]] = meaningless
*[[mauton]] = tasteless
*[[näkymätön]] = invisible
*[[kuolematon]] = immortal
*[[ääretön]] = infinite

